*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Units that before were impractical due to their hefty cost and cooldown like Talented Dark Lazer or [[Beefcake Cat]] now get to show their true power as they mow through everything. And of course, with these restrictions in play [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] becomes a lean, mean, 1350¢ killing machine with only around 30 seconds of cooldown.

This stage starts with a few peons for money, right before Bores begin to spawn. While things may get more chaotic with a Loris Cursing your anti-Red units, you can just ignore this stage entirely and rush it by farming the peons for money, killing Bore quickly then rushing the stage before anything else spawns.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
''Given the nature of this Colosseum, you should prioritize using Special Cats.''
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Dark Lazer]]: Dark Lazer's omega high DPS becomes even more ridiculous given how fast her cooldown becomes under these restrictions. Expect the Bore to die instantly. If your Dark Lazer doesn't have full Talents, consider using Strong Up [[Cat Combo]].

